WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.343
Let's install Quantity Tiers with MultiTier Discounts,
using the Fieldnote demo store.

2
00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:12.121
Quantity Tiers explains a product's quantity discount.
Cart Progress is a different widget for spending

3
00:00:12.121 --> 00:00:17.691
offers. This walkthrough focuses on Quantity Tiers,
from installation to the real checkout.

4
00:00:18.741 --> 00:00:25.454
In Online Store, open Themes and choose the theme you
want to test. We are using an unpublished recording

5
00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:27.220
copy, not the live theme.

6
00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:33.840
In the theme editor, open the Cobalt notebook's
product template. Find a section that supports app

7
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.367
blocks, then choose Add block, Apps, and Quantity
Tiers.

8
00:00:37.717 --> 00:00:43.353
Place the block beside the purchase controls. Make
sure you are editing the template used by this

9
00:00:43.353 --> 00:00:45.674
product, rather than a different product template.

10
00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:52.347
The campaign already exists: two Cobalt notebooks
receive ten percent off, and three or more receive

11
00:00:52.347 --> 00:00:57.879
fifteen percent off. The widget displays the offer; it
does not create the discount.

12
00:00:58.929 --> 00:01:05.756
Open the Quantity Tiers settings. Give it a short
title and a subtitle that matches the campaign. Keep

13
00:01:05.756 --> 00:01:08.411
Show quantity selector enabled for this example.

14
00:01:08.761 --> 00:01:15.321
Save the draft theme, then preview that same theme and
product. Start with the default integration settings;

15
00:01:15.321 --> 00:01:19.179
you do not need technical selectors for this standard
setup.

16
00:01:19.529 --> 00:01:26.466
Choose two in the widget and add them to the cart.
Confirm two notebooks and thirty-two dollars and forty

17
00:01:26.466 --> 00:01:31.942
cents. Test the widget's own button instead of
assuming it follows the theme's separate quantity

18
00:01:31.942 --> 00:01:32.307
field.

19
00:01:32.657 --> 00:01:35.508
Empty the test cart before the next example.

20
00:01:36.558 --> 00:01:44.010
Now check the next tier on the same Cobalt product.
Select three in the widget. The campaign gives fifteen

21
00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:47.933
percent off each qualifying notebook, not ten plus
fifteen percent.

22
00:01:48.283 --> 00:01:54.078
The widget estimates forty-five dollars and ninety
cents for three notebooks. Add them with its own

23
00:01:54.078 --> 00:01:57.339
button and compare that estimate with the real cart.

24
00:01:57.689 --> 00:02:03.687
Confirm three notebooks, fifteen percent off, and
forty-five dollars and ninety cents. The original

25
00:02:03.687 --> 00:02:08.829
price is fifty-four dollars; the saving is eight
dollars and ten cents.

26
00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:16.818
Open checkout and compare the same product, quantity
and discount. For three Cobalt notebooks, the

27
00:02:16.818 --> 00:02:20.981
discounted merchandise amount remains forty-five
dollars and ninety cents.

28
00:02:21.331 --> 00:02:27.625
Shipping and taxes may be separate. Check the
merchandise calculation rather than expecting every

29
00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:30.322
checkout total to ignore delivery costs.

30
00:02:30.672 --> 00:02:37.147
We will not enter contact or payment details, and we
will not place an order. Return to the cart when the

31
00:02:37.147 --> 00:02:37.764
amounts match.

32
00:02:38.814 --> 00:02:45.981
Return to the cart and remove the notebooks. The cart
should become empty, with no duplicate rows or stale

33
00:02:45.981 --> 00:02:47.113
discount left behind.

34
00:02:47.463 --> 00:02:54.242
Use the theme editor's mobile preview to inspect text
and spacing. Previewing the layout is useful, but also

35
00:02:54.242 --> 00:02:58.385
test the actual product and cart on a phone before
launch.

36
00:02:58.735 --> 00:03:04.833
Gift Auto-Add is a separate app embed for gift
campaigns. Quantity Tiers does not require you to

37
00:03:04.833 --> 00:03:08.420
enable it, and this tutorial does not change its
settings.

38
00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:16.691
Our test cart is empty. The disposable recording theme
can now be removed; the original demo campaign and

39
00:03:16.691 --> 00:03:17.894
theme stay unchanged.

40
00:03:18.244 --> 00:03:25.163
If a widget is missing, check the theme, template,
block placement and campaign eligibility first. If the

41
00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:31.267
actual discount is wrong, check the campaign rather
than changing the widget's colors or selectors.

42
00:03:31.617 --> 00:03:38.069
Keep your own theme as a draft until the product page,
cart and checkout all match the offer. The written

43
00:03:38.069 --> 00:03:40.972
widget guide includes these checks for your own store.
